    "transcription": "雪崖洞在黔陽城外南明河堤西南里許，四面山形環繞，人烟叢集。洞上建設廟宇廊廡，類多仙□，題咏古迹，寡人文華聚之所，往來遊玩之區也。",
    "translation": "Xueya Cave lies approximately one li southwest of the Nanming River embankment outside Qianyang City. Mountains encircle it on all sides, and dwellings cluster closely together. Temples and covered halls have been built above the cave. There are many [unreadable phrase about immortals], inscriptions and poetic compositions about historic sites. It is a place where literary refinement gathers [the wording of the preceding phrase is uncertain], and a district frequented by visitors for recreation.",
