    "translation": "The Robe-Wearing Gelao live in Pingyuan Prefecture. Men and women wear an inner garment a little more than a foot long, with a robe draped over it, shorter in front and longer at the back. The collar or covering is [unreadable], and the garment is woven from [unreadable]-colored woolen cloth. Their disposition is described as honest and cautious. They work diligently at farming and also earn a living as blacksmiths.",
    "translation_status": "ai_draft",
