    "notes": "依上傳曼徹斯特本原圖按竪排自右向左試錄；存疑字保留□；非人工定稿，歷史族稱反映原編繪者立場。 英文為試譯性概述，並非逐字對譯。",
    "english_kind": "source_aligned_translation_draft",
    "prior_english_summary_20261122": "The Pipa Gelao are described in Pingyuan. They wear short inner garments with an outer robe shorter in front and longer behind; part of the clothing description is uncertain. The compiler characterizes them as diligent farmers who also earn a living from ironworking.",
