    "page_kind": "caption",
    "status": "image_checked_draft",
    "ocr_raw": "白龍家在大定府之平遠州，衣尚白，多入山取漆汁，貿易城市。凡物皆背負，頗循漢禮。",
    "transcription": "白龍家在大定府之平遠州，衣尚白，多入山取漆汁，貿易城市。凡物皆背負，頗循漢禮。",
    "translation": "The Bailongjia live in Pingyuan Prefecture under Dading. They favor white clothing. Many go into the mountains to collect lacquer sap and trade in towns. They carry all goods on their backs and generally follow Han rituals.",
