    "page_kind": "caption",
    "status": "image_checked_draft",
    "ocr_raw": "雞雀苗在貴陽府屬。女子以白布鑲其胸前及兩袖之間，裙□如之，故名雞雀。居高山種雜糧為食，語似雀音，緣□在官，惟盼鄉老之言。",
    "transcription": "雞雀苗在貴陽府屬。女子以白布鑲其胸前及兩袖之間，裙□如之，故名雞雀。居高山種雜糧為食，語似雀音，緣□在官，惟盼鄉老之言。",
    "translation": "The Jique Miao live under Guiyang Prefecture. Women trim the front of their garments and the areas between both sleeves with white cloth; the skirt [unreadable word] is similarly decorated, hence the name Jique. They dwell high in the mountains and cultivate mixed grains for food. Their speech is likened to birdsong. [An unclear clause mentions official authority.] They heed only the words of village elders.",
