    "ocr_raw": "黑生苗在清平郡境內，性情兇惡，不知富之□，所居□則□連惡黨，執火把、持長鏢利刃以劫之。自雍正十三年征服，今皆守法。",
    "transcription": "黑生苗在清平郡境內，性情兇惡，不知富之□，所居□則□連惡黨，執火把、持長鏢利刃以劫之。自雍正十三年征服，今皆守法。",
    "translation": "The Heisheng Miao live within Qingping. The compiler calls their disposition wicked and fierce. [An unclear phrase mentions wealth or poverty.] Where they dwell, they [unreadable] join together with violent companions, carrying torches, long javelins, and sharp blades to rob others. Since their subjugation in the thirteenth year of Yongzheng, they are all said now to obey the law.",
