    "english_kind": "source_aligned_translation_draft",
    "prior_english_summary_20261122": "The compiler places the Heisheng Miao near Qingping and, in hostile language, accuses them of carrying torches and weapons to raid others. The text claims that following a Yongzheng-period military campaign they began observing the law. Several characters in the accusation remain uncertain.",
