    "transcription": "高坡苗又名頂坡苗，平遠、黔西兩州皆有之。喜種山坡，婦女以木板尺許綰髮。兩□婚自苟合，以擇配，善染工織。",
    "translation": "The Gaopo Miao, also called Dingpo Miao, live in both Pingyuan and Qianxi prefectures. They like cultivating mountain slopes. Women arrange their hair with a wooden board about one foot long. [An unclear phrase about two groups] enter relationships and select marriage partners; they are skilled at dyeing and weaving.",
